ot/pull/119668.patch","merged_at":"2026-08-26T19:39:28Z"},"body":"## What problem(s) does this PR solve?\r\n\r\nASTC texture decompression would sometimes fail if the output mipmap's offset was not aligned to 8 bytes.\r\n\r\n## Additional information\r\n\r\nThis has been present in the codebase since #72031. I believe it's a bug as this check only makes sense when dealing with compressed data buffers, which have to be strictly aligned to 16 bytes. \r\nThe pointer here is passed to `astcenc_image`'s data field, which doesn't have such requirements, as proven by the compression code.","closed_by":{"login":"Repiteo","id":17489292,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NDg5Mjky","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17489292?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo","html_url":"https://github.com/Repiteo","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/119668/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/119668/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":null}